        "id": 1373864
      },
      "writtenOn": "2021-03-10T14:34:39Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think it\u0027d be good to incorporate a (substring) check of the panic message here. There are many panics in the codebase, and it isn\u0027t that hard to get a failure with a different panic than the intended one, which would mean the test can be entirely broken and still pass. The caller should be more specific on which panic they expect.",
